title: "Project Vekta: an unofficial PC port of Killzone HD by static recompilation"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-31"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Morinaga
    email: me@gustavomorinaga.dev
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavomorinaga/project-vekta"
url: "https://gustavomorinaga.github.io/project-vekta/"
abstract: >-
  An unofficial native PC port of Killzone HD (PS3) by static recompilation of its PPU and SPU code on ps3recomp,
  with the PS3 system software it calls reimplemented and graphics on Vulkan, for Linux and Windows. Contains no
  game code or data.
keywords: [static recompilation, ps3recomp, PlayStation 3, Vulkan, PC port]
